 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Me, te, lhe, nos, lhes",
     "texto": [
      "To say **to whom**: **me** (to me), **te** (to you), **lhe** (to you formal, him, her), **nos** (to us), **lhes** (to them or to you plural).",
      "Example: **Disse-lhe que sim** (I told him yes). As in Spanish, **lhe** is used for «le» and for formal «you»."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Position",
     "texto": [
      "Like the other pronouns: after the verb with a hyphen in affirmative sentences (**dei-lhe**, I gave him), and before the verb with **não** or **nunca** (**não lhe disse**, I didn't tell him)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
